Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.60,0:00:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.10,0:00:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.90,0:00:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下 {\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が {\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.10,0:02:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.90,0:02:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.80,0:03:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道是 看到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:03.20,0:03:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪裏 看到哪裏了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.00,0:03:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,書店 有好多舊書
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.50,0:03:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舊書店啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.40,0:03:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店名是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:14.40,0:03:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是個怎樣的書店 有些什麼樣的書
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎樣的書
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.30,0:03:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,漫畫 小說 外文書什麼的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:27.20,0:03:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉默不語我怎麼能知道啊 只有書名也行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:36.30,0:03:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼不說呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.70,0:03:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道是些大人看的雜誌嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.20,0:03:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說中了啊 原來如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.90,0:03:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放着好多H書的書店啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.40,0:03:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一你這白癡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.48,0:04:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\an4\fn@幼圓}新店開張
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:06.92,0:04:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇看見的是個擺着許多低級的書的舊書店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:17.85,0:04:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旁邊是個老舊的咖啡廳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.00,0:04:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店主是個帶着鸚鵡長得像癩蛤蟆老頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.90,0:04:29.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那店到底在哪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.42,0:04:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子到底想幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.31,0:04:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐到底要做什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.85,0:04:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰知道呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.17,0:04:52.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係 出現萬一的情況我們就把那男的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:53.62,0:04:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.72,0:05:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此 確實像癩蛤蟆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:21.49,0:05:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隨便問問吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.88,0:05:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.25,0:05:36.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.37,0:05:52.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昭和40年之前的這類雜誌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.74,0:05:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本店基本還有存貨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.13,0:05:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是地獄通信我完全沒有印象
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.85,0:05:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼時候的書呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.59,0:06:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不 沒有就算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.54,0:06:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四個漢字爲書名的書幾乎哪個時代都有不少
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.85,0:06:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,封面是什麼樣子呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.43,0:06:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是寫實風格還是迷幻風格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是穿衣服還是不穿衣服呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.74,0:06:22.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,應該是我記錯了 忘掉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.55,0:06:26.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個男人和地獄通信沒有關係嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我感覺應該有什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且那隻鳥怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.53,0:06:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可疑 太可疑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個男人和鳥 哪個纔是本體
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.85,0:06:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在說什麼啊 要振作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.38,0:06:38.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛爲什麼要來這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.84,0:06:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白天是不是有個女孩來過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.00,0:06:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 熟人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:44.85,0:06:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 看到她進了這個店
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.60,0:06:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有點在意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.63,0:06:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在這裏幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.93,0:06:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瀏覽了一下 那旁書架上的書
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.37,0:07:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前偶然也來過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.75,0:07:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看似是優等生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.02,0:07:06.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有興趣就進來看看的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.04,0:07:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過還是頭一會看見那麼漂亮的孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.50,0:07:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.58,0:07:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,煉獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.12,0:07:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道煉獄通信吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.85,0:07:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一天 一個老朋友跟我這麼說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.10,0:07:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的殺意無法抑制
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.67,0:07:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,終於將寄往煉獄通信的信封
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.38,0:07:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放進了信箱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.63,0:07:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,霎時間 感到了背後有什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.62,0:07:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猛回頭間看到一個美麗動人而又楚楚可憐的少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.89,0:07:57.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,煉獄少女就站在那裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.98,0:08:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美麗動人而又楚楚可憐啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.03,0:08:03.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,登錄地獄通信的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.92,0:08:07.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女就會幫你消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.07,0:08:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和故事裏說的一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.54,0:08:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要寄出煉獄通信的信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:13.75,0:08:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,煉獄少女就會幫你消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.47,0:08:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,問題是這個故事已經是50多年前寫的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.99,0:08:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.79,0:08:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是偶然的一致嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz-90\fn@幼圓\pos(514,116)}圖    文
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作者名與下地獄的發音相似
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.39,0:08:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寺石雄智朗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.05,0:08:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寺石雄智朗　寺石雄智朗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.59,0:08:35.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個人是作者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.68,0:08:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,煉獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.12,0:08:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你剛纔在找的不是雜誌而是這個嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.89,0:08:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.99,0:08:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這麼回事 他還有其他作品嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.74,0:08:53.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.40,0:08:58.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向這類雜誌投稿的很多人會用多個筆名
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.03,0:09:01.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是每個筆名只用一次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.40,0:09:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寺石雄智朗 圖和文章都是他寫的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:07.92,0:09:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這幅畫雖說是福元的風格
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:11.81,0:09:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但其它的完全不一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.90,0:09:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 也許是許多人共同創作的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.09,0:09:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 這個是《肉與櫻》啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.79,0:09:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那當時的主編還活着呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.08,0:09:29.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫宮部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.22,0:09:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打擾了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.94,0:09:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是剛纔來電話的柴田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.54,0:09:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 客人來了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.39,0:09:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打擾了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.15,0:09:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是柴田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:48.50,0:09:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是要和我談談《肉與櫻》吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:52.12,0:09:53.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請坐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.43,0:09:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.86,0:09:58.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寺石雄智朗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.69,0:10:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 說的是煉獄通信的作者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個是福元先生寫的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.17,0:10:09.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.90,0:10:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當時在我們這裏畫雜誌封面和插畫的畫家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.92,0:10:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出過故事的也只有這一部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.20,0:10:17.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是江黑堂的店主說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.04,0:10:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然其中一幅是福元的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.40,0:10:21.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但其它都不是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:22.31,0:10:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他特意改變畫風的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.21,0:10:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.90,0:10:35.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這張照片是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:36.07,0:10:42.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 這是有一次作家們去熱海旅行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,左邊的就是福元
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:45.16,0:10:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個批鬥篷的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.62,0:10:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對 然後旁邊的就是大河內
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.84,0:10:52.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是當時我們的頭號作家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和福元是搭檔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.67,0:10:58.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兩人私下似乎交情也很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.89,0:11:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在這之後不久
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.14,0:11:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大河內就死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.86,0:11:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲大河內死得太突然了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.84,0:11:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們因爲怎麼填補他的空缺起了很大的爭執
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:13.90,0:11:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在這時福元帶着那篇稿子出現了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.69,0:11:20.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從內容來說有些不足
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.96,0:11:22.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是已經沒時間了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:22.79,0:11:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了趕着截稿日期就姑且登載了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.79,0:11:30.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過外界評價並不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:30.67,0:11:31.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,無論故事還是插畫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.08,0:11:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都和我們風格不符
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:34.22,0:11:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是煉獄少女過於清秀了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:38.48,0:11:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是說這個嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:39.80,0:11:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本來這裏準備了別的插畫的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.89,0:11:45.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我換掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.96,0:11:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用了福元從前的作品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.18,0:11:51.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,畫本身可是很出色的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.75,0:11:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然和雜誌風格不合
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.21,0:11:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也許是他平生最高的傑作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:58.79,0:12:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是本來的煉獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.37,0:12:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.50,0:12:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.98,0:12:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,煉獄通信的主人公是雜誌的插畫家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.37,0:12:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一個漂亮的妻子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.53,0:12:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,某天當紅作家“大”染指了他的妻子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.53,0:12:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}“大”暗指大河內
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.95,0:12:28.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她因此自殺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:30.41,0:12:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主人公因此對“大”萌生了巨大的殺意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.54,0:12:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.67,0:12:40.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元的妻子真是位美麗的女性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.61,0:12:44.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是有一天突然自殺了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自殺的理由不太清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.91,0:12:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元也什麼都沒說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.90,0:12:55.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後不久大河內就死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.85,0:12:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也是死因不明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.68,0:12:59.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相似啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.21,0:13:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妻子自殺後朋友也死去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.78,0:13:06.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和故事情節簡直一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.74,0:13:08.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.84,0:13:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許是從兩人的死中迸發的靈感吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:12.46,0:13:14.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元先生現在在哪裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.01,0:13:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰知道他是活着還是死了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.30,0:13:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後因爲出版條例等限制這個行業也冷清了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.17,0:13:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也聽說過福元去了某處畫電影廣告牌的傳言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.18,0:13:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不介意是50年前的地址的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.50,0:13:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,50年 小鎮的樣子一定變了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.56,0:13:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元還會在那裏嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.73,0:13:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有比這更大的變化了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.16,0:13:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鎮已經沒有了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.75,0:14:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然四處散佈着民宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.31,0:14:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但已經再也不能稱爲小鎮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:07.78,0:14:10.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾經是商社的破舊公寓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:11.62,0:14:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在和廢樓沒啥兩樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:17.20,0:14:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:21.83,0:14:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元先生 福元先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.05,0:14:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元先生 您在裏面吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:38.51,0:14:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他肯定在裏面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:42.78,0:14:43.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:49.34,0:14:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.59,0:14:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有話想跟您說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:58.85,0:14:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.16,0:15:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟您談一下這個女孩的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.47,0:15:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您的作品 煉獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:09.60,0:15:12.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我在現實中見過這個女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:16.20,0:15:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字叫閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.43,0:15:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被稱作地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.04,0:15:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,進來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:28.97,0:15:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:31.99,0:15:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經沒有多少時日了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.76,0:15:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想被無聊的事煩到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:38.48,0:15:39.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,時日？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:41.61,0:15:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我全身都是毛病
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:45.02,0:15:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天暴斃也不奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.70,0:15:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就單刀直入
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:52.40,0:15:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您曾經見過地獄少女吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:59.45,0:16:00.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏的故事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.93,0:16:03.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實是您的親身經歷吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.38,0:16:13.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼蠢話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:13.55,0:16:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道她是什麼人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:17.00,0:16:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有她爲什麼要這樣做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.39,0:16:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一個叫地獄通信的主頁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:23.49,0:16:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,據說在那裏寫下怨恨的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.67,0:16:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨就會消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:27.59,0:16:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多年輕人都在登錄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.78,0:16:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有很多人失蹤了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.70,0:16:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎樣 我都要阻止這種事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:38.21,0:16:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的年代是報紙的尋人欄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:45.39,0:16:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我從大河內那裏聽說的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:48.24,0:16:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說過地獄通訊的傳言嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.44,0:16:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要寄信給地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.09,0:16:57.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他們就能替你消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.25,0:17:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聯繫地址寫在報紙尋人欄的空白處
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:05.04,0:17:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但若不是胸懷執怨便看不見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.72,0:17:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我當時覺得這事件和我沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.04,0:17:18.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.64,0:17:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有生以來第一次真的想殺人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:34.06,0:17:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當我這樣想的時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.98,0:17:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1700,0)}君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.96,0:17:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都如那裏所寫的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.84,0:17:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她這麼說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:57.17,0:17:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 怨恨若被消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.88,0:18:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.18,0:18:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死後你的靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:09.41,0:18:12.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 這就是所謂那代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:13.20,0:18:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前往地獄的刻印
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.60,0:18:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約時我覺得那還是很久以後的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:25.89,0:18:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在回想起來 我的人生就是和這刻印的鬥爭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:32.30,0:18:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了忘記刻印的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.93,0:18:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾經拼命工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.32,0:18:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也曾通過修行尋求救贖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.76,0:18:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自暴自棄投身於賭博
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.76,0:18:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也曾想稍微爲世人付出 參加志願者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.66,0:19:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是無論做什麼心靈都得不到解放
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:03.02,0:19:06.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個刻印提醒着我的命運
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.30,0:19:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是死後墜入地獄 永遠在苦痛中延續
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.57,0:19:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓你看看我最後的作品吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:37.21,0:19:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:39.11,0:19:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下了地獄的話 也許還能見到這女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:45.23,0:19:46.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是我唯一的期待
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.81,0:19:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,期待 她毀了你的人生啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.34,0:19:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:56.92,0:20:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毀了我的人生的是大河內啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:00.70,0:20:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.97,0:20:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當時大河內帶着防身的手槍
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.60,0:20:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我自己想爲妻子報仇的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:11.26,0:20:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也許反會被他殺死
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:14.84,0:20:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很感謝她啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.87,0:20:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什麼人 地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:22.99,0:20:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是人外之人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.82,0:20:28.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 也許曾經是人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:29.80,0:20:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看江戶時代中期書籍
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:32.70,0:20:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經有關於地獄少女的記述
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.79,0:20:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,江戶時代
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:38.75,0:20:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 更早一點吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:41.30,0:20:43.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許能到安土桃山時代吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.16,0:20:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戰國時代
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:48.39,0:20:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼您會寫煉獄通信這個故事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:52.41,0:20:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許不是我 而是她的意志
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:57.73,0:21:01.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之 必須向誰來傳達
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:02.53,0:21:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向誰傳達 那是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:09.18,0:21:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯 就是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:54.66,0:21:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在哭嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:56.92,0:21:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:08.40,0:22:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福元先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.42,0:22:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,終於見面了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:28.93,0:22:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你還是沒變
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.42,0:22:34.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是那麼美麗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:40.67,0:22:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在地獄能和大河內見面了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:50.63,0:22:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄也是個很遼闊的地方
