Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:29.45,0:24:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.18,0:24:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.04,0:24:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桐野沙樹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:35.54,0:24:39.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說你父親沒錯嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:39.48,0:24:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,錯的是那個男人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:41.49,0:24:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父親只是想揭露他的罪狀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:44.33,0:24:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.91,0:24:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父親好可憐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:47.65,0:24:49.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.76,0:24:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那傢伙流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:53.08,0:24:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.96,0:25:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&\an7}下集
